[2,VISIBLE_BLOCK,1126] quoted=False asset acquisition and allocated the cost of the acquisition, including direct and incremental transaction costs, on a relative fair value basis, to an indefinite-lived brand asset of approximately $290 million and contract assets, with a weighted-average term of 20 years, totaling $60 million.
